### Etape 3 - liste des modules actifs
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/modules

### Etape 3 - module inexistant (404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/modules/999

### Etape 4 - creer un cours (201)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cours
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombreHeureGlobal": 60,
  "moduleId": 2,
  "professeurId": 1,
  "semestreId": 1,
  "classeIds": [1, 2]
}
### Etape 4 - module inconnu (404)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cours
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombreHeureGlobal": 60, "moduleId": 999, "professeurId": 1, "semestreId": 1, "classeIds": [1, 2] }

### Etape 4 - classe inconnue (404)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cours
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombreHeureGlobal": 60, "moduleId": 2, "professeurId": 1, "semestreId": 1, "classeIds": [1, 999] }

### Etape 4 - aucune classe (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cours
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombreHeureGlobal": 60, "moduleId": 2, "professeurId": 1, "semestreId": 1, "classeIds": [] }

### Etape 4 - nombreHeureGlobal negatif (400, validation)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cours
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombreHeureGlobal": -5, "moduleId": 2, "professeurId": 1, "semestreId": 1, "classeIds": [1] }

### Etape 4 - semestre hors de l'annee courante (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cours
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombreHeureGlobal": 60, "moduleId": 2, "professeurId": 1, "semestreId": 2, "classeIds": [1] }


### Etape 5 - preparation : cours du professeur 1 (quota 60)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cours
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombreHeureGlobal": 60, "moduleId": 2, "professeurId": 1, "semestreId": 1, "classeIds": [1] }

> {% client.global.set("coursId", response.body.results.id); %}

### Etape 5 - preparation : cours du professeur 2 (petit quota de 3 heures)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cours
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombreHeureGlobal": 3, "moduleId": 3, "professeurId": 2, "semestreId": 1, "classeIds": [2] }

> {% client.global.set("coursQuotaId", response.body.results.id); %}

### Etape 5 - 1. nominal presentiel (201, nombreHeure = 3)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cours/{{coursId}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-11-12", "heureDebut": "10:00", "heureFin": "13:00", "typeSession": "PRESENTIEL", "salleId": 1 }

### Etape 5 - 2. nominal en ligne (201)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cours/{{coursId}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-11-13", "heureDebut": "09:00", "heureFin": "11:00", "typeSession": "EN_LIGNE", "lienVisio": "https://meet.ecole221.sn/spring" }

### Etape 5 - 3. cours inconnu (404)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cours/999/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-11-12", "heureDebut": "09:00", "heureFin": "12:00", "typeSession": "PRESENTIEL", "salleId": 1 }

### Etape 5 - 4. heure de fin avant le debut (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cours/{{coursId}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-11-20", "heureDebut": "12:00", "heureFin": "10:00", "typeSession": "PRESENTIEL", "salleId": 1 }

### Etape 5 - 5. presentiel sans salle (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cours/{{coursId}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-11-20", "heureDebut": "09:00", "heureFin": "11:00", "typeSession": "PRESENTIEL" }

### Etape 5 - 6. en ligne avec une salle (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cours/{{coursId}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-11-20", "heureDebut": "09:00", "heureFin": "11:00", "typeSession": "EN_LIGNE", "salleId": 1, "lienVisio": "https://meet.ecole221.sn/x" }

### Etape 5 - 7. en ligne sans lien visio (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cours/{{coursId}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-11-20", "heureDebut": "09:00", "heureFin": "11:00", "typeSession": "EN_LIGNE" }

### Etape 5 - 8. date hors du semestre (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cours/{{coursId}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2027-03-01", "heureDebut": "09:00", "heureFin": "11:00", "typeSession": "PRESENTIEL", "salleId": 1 }

### Etape 5 - 9. quota depasse (409) : 4 heures demandees pour un quota de 3
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cours/{{coursQuotaId}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-11-20", "heureDebut": "08:00", "heureFin": "12:00", "typeSession": "PRESENTIEL", "salleId": 2 }

### Etape 5 - 10. salle occupee (409) : salle 1 deja prise le 12/11 de 10:00 a 13:00 (test 1)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cours/{{coursQuotaId}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-11-12", "heureDebut": "11:00", "heureFin": "12:00", "typeSession": "PRESENTIEL", "salleId": 1 }

### Etape 5 - 11. professeur occupe (409) : professeur 1 deja en cours le 12/11 de 10:00 a 13:00 (test 1)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cours/{{coursId}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-11-12", "heureDebut": "11:00", "heureFin": "12:00", "typeSession": "PRESENTIEL", "salleId": 2 }

### Etape 5 - borne : 13:00-15:00 dans la salle 1 ne chevauche PAS 10:00-13:00 (201)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cours/{{coursQuotaId}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-11-12", "heureDebut": "13:00", "heureFin": "15:00", "typeSession": "PRESENTIEL", "salleId": 1 }

